 identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within complex numbers and geometry. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, topology of c carries the completed idea into complex functions and limits."}]}, {"id": "c6e3271a-2d0b-4db2-96d4-45974e25aac4", "type": "topic", "title": "Complex functions and limits", "description": "This module builds directly on complex numbers and geometry and develops complex functions and limits. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for complex differentiability.", "children": [{"id": "8be3a331-d75f-4c52-a303-fadc4822664a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Mappings", "children": [], "description": "Mappings gives complex functions and limits a reusable representation for organizing assumptions, variables, and relationships before analysis begins. It appears before continuity because that next topic assumes this starting point."}, {"id": "388b662a-7755-4d0e-bf21-b7bdfbb74533", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Continuity", "children": [], "description": "Continuity identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within complex functions and limits. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. After mappings, continuity supplies what is needed to address branches."}, {"id": "a868d6b3-e536-4e7b-a499-2e9bdbd4c6c9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Branches", "children": [], "description": "Branches identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within complex functions and limits. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. After continuity, branches supplies what is needed to address elementary functions."}, {"id": "97478cf5-6ea9-4e84-8e18-a8c9caf35b48", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Elementary functions", "children": [], "description": "Elementary functions identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within complex functions and limits. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, elementary functions carries the completed idea into complex differentiability."}]}, {"id": "6d8b2b62-1104-402d-8060-1bba3bbf32e0", "type": "topic", "title": "Complex differentiability", "description": "This module builds directly on complex functions and limits and develops complex differentiability. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for power series.", "children": [{"id": "0ce0aef9-6d8a-46b0-8447-1289cdaf1751", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cauchy–Riemann equations", "children": [], "description": "Cauchy–Riemann equations identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within complex differentiability. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. It appears before analyticity because that next topic assumes this starting point."}, {"id": "e66e40d9-c896-4ed0-8bdf-6568196747f4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Analyticity", "children": [], "description": "Analyticity identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within complex differentiability. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. After cauchy–riemann equations, analyticity supplies what is needed to address harmonic functions."}, {"id": "48dc5d97-f554-47a0-ab98-031872cb94e5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Harmonic functions", "children": [], "description": "Harmonic functions identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within complex differentiability. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, harmonic functions carries the completed idea into power series."}]}, {"id": "90af2b05-b292-474e-91b7-40f673f4120c", "type": "topic", "title": "Power series", "description": "This module builds directly on 